<p>Take aim for 1 turn, preparing a deadly shot. During the next turn, this talent will be replaced with the ability to fire a lethal shot dealing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">250%, 283%, 309%, 330%, 350%</acronym> damage and marking the target.</p><p>While aiming, your intense focus causes you to shrug off <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">35%, 48%, 55%, 61%, 65%</acronym> incoming damage and all negative effects.</p><p>This requires a bow to use.</p>